\pard\plain \fi720\sl288\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Ghosts bored of people who do the same things as their forebears.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Bored as hell of people who follow in other people\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s footsteps}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 If I were to write a self help book, it would say, find the experiences which only you can experience.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Hordes of ghosts following people no one knows about, the novelty of it.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Fuck:}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://preview.redd.it/c4av8c9ac3lh1.jpeg?width=720&auto=webp&s=cfa3b85c3b6d93062b405112f3882499c8ad4f3c"}{\fldrslt\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 https://preview.redd.it/c4av8c9ac3lh1.jpeg?width=720&auto=webp&s=cfa3b85c3b6d93062b405112f3882499c8ad4f3c}}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93You die three times, first when the body dies, second, when your body enters the grave, and third, when your name is spoken for the last time\u8230\'85.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Every time I see the word \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8216\'91ok\u8217\'92, or \u8216\'91okay\u8217\'92, I think of Martin Van buren\u8217\'92s presidential campaign. It irks me whenever it pops up in a historical play or fantansy novel. This tendentious, because every every single word is dripping with history. History, from the Greek historia, Herodotus \u8216\'91the Histories\u8217\'92, derivative of histor, \u8220\'93knowing, expert; witnes\u8221\'94 as in hyperhistor \u8220\'93knowing all too well\u8221\'94. The word spread over the Ionic world, together with Ionic science and philosophy. I am not bothered by the word \u8216\'91history\u8217\'92 like I am by the word \u8216\'91okay\u8217\'92. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 I will start with the girl. She is threaded through everything here, but I wont mention her again because you will get tired of it. I will describe her. Don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t believe any of it, because when I met her I was a very lonely man and built up a fantasy of her to feed my desperate need to be chosen by someone. She *is* in this description, somewhere. A creature of the woods type of person. A face that said she was emotionally unavailable. Big bright eyes that scrunched up when she smiled, so she wasn\u8217\'92t as attractive when she smiled. It was when she stared at you. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 There is no good for the human brain. The default is to say the world is bad, or needs improvement, because what use is there for equanimity. It motivates nothing. You will not out compete if you don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t view it as a competition.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Nothing will soothe the upheaval.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 An opposite to a patent expiring: the work of art must be forgotten after a certain period of time, so that new growth can happen.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 These people didn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t think it all the way through. These thinkers are locked in. And what will it look like ten thousand years from now? You can\u8217\'92t possibly learn from all these philosophers. There no room for any more.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1}